# Keep the image build context lean and free of local-only data. private/
# holds real user recordings and internal docs (never leaves the machine,
# CLAUDE.md), tests/ carries fixtures and reports the image build never
# needs, and .env.local may carry a real analytics/Sentry id - a default
# image must contact nothing.
node_modules
dist
.git
private
tests
.env*
!.env.example
